    "detailed_description": "Aim for the &quot;peak&quot; of the freak world with a card game! FREE.KS PEAK, a trading card game full of freaks.<br>Defeat enemies and acquire cards. Build your deck with the cards you get and become the best card player!<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br><br>This is a world where non-human &quot;Free.ks&quot; gather.<br>It is ruled by a powerful emperor named Dorotea, and the Free.ks compete for strength in a card game called &quot;Peak&quot;.<br>As kings who rule their respective lands, there are Yueping, Cleao, Cheche, Mary, Frank, Neruru, and Camille. To fulfill their ambitions, they aim for even greater heights in &quot;Peak&quot;\u30fc<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457730/extras/e95ae976d55a216980ca49348f8770a5.poster.avif?t=1742579415\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457730/extras/e95ae976d55a216980ca49348f8770a5.webm?t=1742579415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457730/extras/e95ae976d55a216980ca49348f8770a5.mp4?t=1742579415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457730/extras/8787d80812ffd7d3fc69f36caab15c11.poster.avif?t=1742579415\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457730/extras/8787d80812ffd7d3fc69f36caab15c11.webm?t=1742579415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></