ee Battle]</strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457730/extras/37b0c745c4f4e66e713d4b5760cf6127.avif?t=1742579415\" /></span><br>Play against any deck, any opponent, and any settings you like!<br><br><strong>[Edit Deck]</strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457730/extras/263ec17f5e75d8be54849e81f24668ae.avif?t=1742579415\" /></span><br>Edit card decks. Build your own deck with your favorite cards!",
